# Waiver: Debian 13 base-image OS packages with no upstream fix available as of
# 2026-07-29 (confirmed via Trivy's empty "Fixed Version" column). None of these
# packages (perl, gzip, util-linux, ncurses, acl) are invoked by ledger-api's
# Flask application code or its dependency tree — they ship as part of the
# python:3.12-slim base image only.
#
# Compensating controls already in place (see task1-hardening/):
#   - readOnlyRootFilesystem: true (no write access even if a package were exploited)
#   - capabilities.drop: [ALL] + non-root UID 10001 (no privilege to exploit setuid/setgid paths)
#   - NetworkPolicy default-deny + Istio mTLS STRICT (limits blast radius / lateral movement)
#
